# Files that must never reach the WordPress.org plugin build.
#
# Consumed by 10up/action-wordpress-plugin-deploy as rsync --exclude-from, which
# syncs SVN trunk with --delete --delete-excluded: whatever is listed here is
# removed from trunk, and whatever is missing here is published. Keep it in sync
# with the rsync excludes in .github/workflows/release.yml.
#
# Note: .wordpress-org is excluded from the plugin itself but is still published
# separately as the SVN assets/ directory (banners, icons, screenshots).

.git
.github
.claude
.gitignore
.distignore
.wordpress-org
node_modules

README.md
README.zh-TW.md
SECURITY.md
omni-webmaster-seo-suite-readme.txt

.DS_Store
*.bak
*.zip
